stateDiagram-v2
    accTitle: Background job lifecycle
    accDescr: All job kinds share this lifecycle. A transactional lease fences each attempt; transient failures retry within three attempts and a 24 hour deadline; deletion or cancellation stops late publication.
    [*] --> queued: request admitted or upload finalized
    queued --> running: worker claims with a new lease
    running --> running: heartbeat, or expired lease reclaimed as a new attempt
    running --> succeeded: outputs verified and fenced publish
    running --> partial: 3D usable with declared missing frames
    running --> retrying: transient failure
    retrying --> running: next attempt
    running --> failed: permanent error or attempts exhausted
    retrying --> failed: 3 attempts or 24 h deadline
    queued --> cancelled: owner cancels or deletes the project
    running --> cancelled: owner cancels or deletes the project
    retrying --> cancelled: owner cancels or deletes the project
    succeeded --> [*]
    partial --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
